Compute divisibility: 9b+7 = 9(b+7) - 56? 9b+63 -56 = 9b+7. Yes. So b+7 | 56. Since b>9, b+7 >16. Positive divisors of 56 greater than 16: 28,56? Also 56 divisors: 1,2,4,7,8,14,28,56. >16: 28,56. Then b = 21,49. Sum =70.

Check: b=21: 17_21=28, 97_21=196? 9*21+7=196, divisible by 28=7. b=49: 56 divides 448? 9*49+7=448, /56=8. Sum 70.

